<hgroup><h1>The preregistration revolution</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Nosek%20BA"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Brian A Nosek</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">Brian A Nosek</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>a</sup>Center for Open Science, Charlottesville, VA 22903;</div>
<div class="p">
<sup>b</sup>Department of Psychology, University of Virginia, Charlottesville, VA 22904</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Nosek%20BA"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Brian A Nosek</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>a,</sup><sup>b,</sup><sup>1</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Ebersole%20CR"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id2"><span class="name western">Charles R Ebersole</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id2">
<h3><span class="name western">Charles R Ebersole</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>b</sup>Department of Psychology, University of Virginia, Charlottesville, VA 22904</div>
